{
	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"phase2_header",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Phase 2: Dashboard Update\n**Tool:** Claude for Excel\n**Skill:** sonrisa-cps-dashboard-update-v0.1\n\n**Skill = the LOGIC**\n**MUB = the DATA**",
			"styleAttributes":{"background":"4"},
			"x":160,
			"y":-1270,
			"width":400,
			"height":200
		},
		{
			"id":"input_mub",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**INPUT 1**\n`MUB_YYYY_MM.md`\n(attached or pasted into Claude for Excel chat)",
			"styleAttributes":{"background":"6"},
			"x":160,
			"y":-1020,
			"width":400,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"input_dashboard",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**INPUT 2**\n`CPS - Dashboard - v2.xlsx`\nOpen in Excel Online (browser)",
			"styleAttributes":{"background":"6"},
			"x":160,
			"y":-880,
			"width":400,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"p2_step1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"1. Open dashboard in Excel Online\n2. Open Claude for Excel sidebar\n3. Attach MUB or paste content",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":160,
			"y":-740,
			"width":400,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"p2_step2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"4. **Per project loop (skill-driven):**\n- Claude reads MUB block for project\n- Announces: \"Next: [Project]. Adding [N] rows. Ready?\"\n- ACK -> writes rows (Status = PREFILLED)\n- Verify in sheet -> ACK -> Status = ACK\n- Next project",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":160,
			"y":-600,
			"width":400,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"p2_step3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"5. Service Income, PSIC, EDC, Team (if applicable)\n6. Final verification: BU Dash1, CPS Dash V2, BU Dash2",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":160,
			"y":-380,
			"width":400,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"output_dashboard",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**OUTPUT**\nUpdated `CPS - Dashboard - v2.xlsx`\nAll rows ACK'd, synced to SharePoint",
			"styleAttributes":{"background":"5"},
			"x":160,
			"y":-240,
			"width":400,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"resumability",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Resumability**\nStatus column AC tracks progress:\n- ACK = done\n- PREFILLED = needs review\n- No status = not started\n- REVIEW = needs discussion\n\nPaste same MUB next session, Claude picks up where you left off.",
			"styleAttributes":{"background":"1"},
			"x":160,
			"y":-100,
			"width":400,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"phase3_header",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Phase 3: TIG Review\n**Tool:** Cowork + tig-review-v0.1",
			"styleAttributes":{"background":"4"},
			"x":800,
			"y":-1270,
			"width":360,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"input_tig",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**INPUT**\nContractor TIG document (SharePoint)\n+ `_base.xlsx` Sontime data",
			"styleAttributes":{"background":"6"},
			"x":800,
			"y":-1060,
			"width":360,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"p3_step1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"1. Say **\"review TIG\"** in Cowork\n2. Downloads TIG from Banfi Istvan's SharePoint folder",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":800,
			"y":-920,
			"width":360,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"p3_step2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"3. Cross-references hours per project with Sontime data\n4. Identifies Account Managers per project",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":800,
			"y":-810,
			"width":360,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"p3_step3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"5. Drafts Hungarian sign-off emails (one per AM)\n6. Creates Gmail drafts (CC: Finance + PM)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":800,
			"y":-700,
			"width":360,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"output_emails",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**OUTPUT**\nGmail drafts\n(AM sign-off requests in Hungarian)",
			"styleAttributes":{"background":"5"},
			"x":800,
			"y":-580,
			"width":360,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"phase4_header",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Phase 4: (TBD)\nInvoice verification, review meeting prep, etc.",
			"styleAttributes":{"background":"1"},
			"x":800,
			"y":-440,
			"width":360,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"phase1_header",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Phase 1: Statistics Processing\n**Tool:** Cowork + cps-statistics-v0.1\n**Rules:** [[MUB_Instructions_v0.2]]",
			"styleAttributes":{"background":"4"},
			"x":-1430,
			"y":-1290,
			"width":360,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"input_raw",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**INPUT 1**\n`activityreport_YYYY_MM (N).xlsx`\nRaw Sontime export from SharePoint",
			"styleAttributes":{"background":"6"},
			"x":-1430,
			"y":-1080,
			"width":360,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"input_example",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**INPUT 2**\n`activityreport_2026_02_Example.xlsx`\nTemplate with pivot tables + team list\n(or user-specified template)",
			"styleAttributes":{"background":"6"},
			"x":-1430,
			"y":-960,
			"width":360,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"p1_step1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"1. Say **\"process timesheets\"** in Cowork\n2. Confirm: which raw file? which template?\n3. Skill reads MUB Instructions + build-process refs",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1430,
			"y":-810,
			"width":360,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"output_base",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**OUTPUT 1**\n`activityreport_YYYY_MM_base.xlsx`\nAll data + CPS table + pivot tables (refreshOnLoad)\n6 sheets from Example template",
			"styleAttributes":{"background":"5"},
			"x":-800,
			"y":-790,
			"width":340,
			"height":130
		},
		{
			"id":"output_tam",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**OUTPUT 2**\n`activityreport_YYYY_MM_tam.xlsx`\nCPS extract for TAMs (11 cols, no Team)",
			"styleAttributes":{"background":"5"},
			"x":-800,
			"y":-630,
			"width":300,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"output_mub",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**OUTPUT 3**\n`MUB_YYYY_MM.md`\nMonthly Update Brief (7 sections):\nSummary, Projects by Client, Person by Client,\nHours Summary, Contractors, Verification\n\n**MUB = the DATA for Phase 2**\nNo rates, no comparison -- skill derives those",
			"styleAttributes":{"background":"3"},
			"x":-800,
			"y":-480,
			"width":340,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"p1_step2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"4. Extract Example template (ZIP PK header scan)\n5. Parse raw file via XML (zipfile + ElementTree)\n6. Filter CPS rows by team member names\n   (FirstName LastName format, 14 members)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1430,
			"y":-680,
			"width":360,
			"height":225
		},
		{
			"id":"p1_step3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"7. Classify all CPS hours into 5 categories:\n   Billable / Internal / MVMI Avail / Sick+Leave / Other\n8. If **Other** exists: ask user, update MUB Instructions\n9. Apply aggregation rules (SIL->Spinwheel, etc.)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1430,
			"y":-420,
			"width":360,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"p1_step4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"10. Generate `_base.xlsx` (XML template + CPSTable)\n11. Generate `_tam.xlsx` (xlsxwriter, CPS only)\n12. Generate `MUB_YYYY_MM.md` (full 7-section template)\n13. Verify: category sum = CPS total",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1430,
			"y":-170,
			"width":360,
			"height":230
		},
		{
			"id":"p1_step5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"14. Save all to `raports/generated/YYYY_Month/`\n15. Upload `_base` + `_tam` to SharePoint\n    (MUB stays local for Phase 2)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1430,
			"y":120,
			"width":360,
			"height":160
		}
	],
